2026-07-27T08:02:04.7271677Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7341304Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7342236Z i /tmp/Rtmp0XDHEh/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7342659Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7343166Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7343773Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7344903Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7345933Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7346716Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7612521Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:02:04.7728384Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:02:04.8205750Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:02:04.8387850Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
